    Let $[\mathcal{Z}_r^{\beta}]$ denote the random zero counting measure of the scaled function $F_{\beta, r}(z) \coloneqq F_\beta(z/r)$, conditioned on the event $\{ n_{F_\beta}(r) = 0 \}$. Then, as $r \to \infty$,
